{
	"title": "Écart-type : valeur exacte",
	"description": "Calculer l'espérance, la variance puis la valeur exacte de l'écart-type d'une variable aléatoire donnée par sa loi",
	"grades": ["1_SPE"],
	"points": ["1SPE-165"],
	"theme": "Probabilités",
	"domain": "Variables aléatoires",
	"subdomain": "Variance et écart-type",
	"level": 3,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 120,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "La loi de probabilité d'une variable aléatoire $X$ est donnée par le tableau suivant.\n\n| $x_k$ | ${{x1}}$ | ${{x2}}$ | ${{x3}}$ |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| $P(X=x_k)$ | ${{eval:a/4}}$ | ${{eval:b/4}}$ | ${{eval:c/4}}$ |\n\nCalcule l'écart-type $\\sigma(X)$. Donne sa valeur exacte sous la forme $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{b}$, où $a$ et $b$ sont des entiers et $a$ est le plus petit possible.\n\n$\\sigma(X)=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x1",
					"expression": "-3..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "d1",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "d2",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "x2",
					"expression": "{{eval:x1+d1}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "x3",
					"expression": "{{eval:x2+d2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..{{eval:3-a}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "{{eval:4-a-b}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "S",
					"expression": "{{eval:a*(x1)+b*(x2)+c*(x3)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "Q",
					"expression": "{{eval:a*(x1)^2+b*(x2)^2+c*(x3)^2}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "E",
					"expression": "{{eval:S/4}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "T",
					"expression": "{{eval:4*Q-S*S}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "g",
					"expression": "{{eval:gcd(T,16)}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "N",
					"expression": "{{eval:T/g}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "D",
					"expression": "{{eval:16/g}}"
				},
				{
					"name": "B",
					"expression": "{{eval:sqrt(D)}}"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"D > 1",
				"sqrt(D) == round(sqrt(D))",
				"N > 1",
				"N <= 120",
				"mod(N,4) != 0",
				"mod(N,9) != 0",
				"mod(N,25) != 0",
				"mod(N,49) != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\frac{\\sqrt{ {{N}} }}{ {{B}} }"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Espérance : $E(X)=\\sum p_k x_k={{eval:a/4}}\\times {{x1;()}}+{{eval:b/4}}\\times {{x2;()}}+{{eval:c/4}}\\times {{x3;()}}={{E}}$.",
					"Par définition, $V(X)=\\sum p_k\\left(x_k-E(X)\\right)^2$.",
					"$V(X)={{eval:a/4}}\\times {{eval:x1-E;()}}^2+{{eval:b/4}}\\times {{eval:x2-E;()}}^2+{{eval:c/4}}\\times {{eval:x3-E;()}}^2={{eval:N/D}}$",
					"Autre méthode (formule de König-Huygens) : $V(X)=E(X^2)-E(X)^2={{eval:Q/4}}-{{E;()}}^2={{eval:N/D}}$.",
					"L'écart-type est la racine carrée de la variance.",
					"$\\sigma(X)=\\sqrt{V(X)}=\\sqrt{ {{eval:N/D}} }=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{ {{N}} }}{\\sqrt{ {{D}} }}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ \\dfrac{\\sqrt{ {{N}} }}{ {{B}} } }$"
				]
			}
		},
